WEBVTT

00:01:49.070 --> 00:01:52.540
Kyoko, you're a widow?

00:01:53.390 --> 00:01:54.590
That's right.

00:01:56.730 --> 00:02:00.240
Forget what has been
put to rest. Be with me!

00:02:04.400 --> 00:02:05.420
That's impossible.

00:02:06.070 --> 00:02:08.290
Aren't I good
enough for you!?

00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:11.390
To be honest, that's
exactly the problem.

00:02:15.080 --> 00:02:17.250
Kyoko, is dinner ready?

00:02:17.410 --> 00:02:18.930
Yes, it is, Soichiro darling!

00:02:23.420 --> 00:02:24.730
He's here! Soichiro!

00:02:27.090 --> 00:02:29.580
Kyoko, wake up!
That man is dead!

00:02:30.090 --> 00:02:31.900
Your husband is gone!

00:02:34.760 --> 00:02:36.980
Soichiro is not dead!

00:02:38.100 --> 00:02:41.350
He's a better man
than you'll ever be!

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:43.940
He's so intelligent.
So kind!

00:02:44.440 --> 00:02:45.310
So handsome!

00:02:47.780 --> 00:02:49.450
Am I handsome or what?

00:02:50.450 --> 00:02:51.380
Soichiro!

00:02:51.780 --> 00:02:52.600
Kyoko...

00:03:17.470 --> 00:03:18.430
Just a dream...

00:03:19.810 --> 00:03:21.710
That was really scary!

00:03:25.480 --> 00:03:28.790
Mrs. Ichinose, do we have
to go through this again?

00:03:29.480 --> 00:03:32.090
Don't be shy! Just take
a look at the pictures.

00:03:32.490 --> 00:03:33.510
See? See?

00:03:34.160 --> 00:03:37.180
This hunk's a ''K'' University
grad, a trading top elite.

00:03:38.490 --> 00:03:40.390
This one has
family connections.

00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:43.590
Personally, I'd go
for the hunk.

00:03:44.170 --> 00:03:47.980
As I've said before, I have
no intention of remarrying.

00:03:48.500 --> 00:03:50.400
No need to decide that now.

00:03:50.840 --> 00:03:52.070
Just take a look!

00:03:54.180 --> 00:03:55.550
What a waste!

00:03:55.840 --> 00:03:57.450
It's okay.
I'm fine as I am.

00:03:58.510 --> 00:03:59.850
I understand the feeling.

00:04:00.180 --> 00:04:02.320
You're devoted to
your one true love.

00:04:02.520 --> 00:04:05.330
But you're behind the
times. And so young.

00:04:05.850 --> 00:04:07.220
Devotion to a dead man...

00:04:08.860 --> 00:04:11.410
Soichiro is not dead!

00:04:19.200 --> 00:04:22.160
I'm just not ready yet.

00:04:27.540 --> 00:04:28.800
By the way, Godai...

00:04:28.880 --> 00:04:29.700
Huh? Y-Yeah?

00:04:30.550 --> 00:04:32.890
It's noon!
Don't you have classes?

00:04:34.550 --> 00:04:36.720
I was thinking of going
to my afternoon class...

00:04:41.560 --> 00:04:42.200
Oh, no!

00:04:43.230 --> 00:04:44.870
You want to see her
panties on the line.

00:04:45.560 --> 00:04:47.230
You gotta be
kidding! Who does!?

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:50.490
Damn!
She figured me out!

00:04:55.900 --> 00:04:58.360
Oh well. Might as
well go to one class.

00:05:16.590 --> 00:05:18.640
Should you still be here?
It's afternoon already.

00:05:20.260 --> 00:05:21.660
No! Down, down!

00:05:22.600 --> 00:05:24.710
Don't, Soichiro!

00:05:28.600 --> 00:05:29.680
Soichiro...

00:05:29.940 --> 00:05:30.790
Kyoko!

00:05:36.610 --> 00:05:37.570
What's the matter?

00:05:39.280 --> 00:05:40.420
T-That's a dog!

00:05:41.950 --> 00:05:43.180
Yes, what about it?

00:05:44.620 --> 00:05:46.930
S-So, you prefer dogs?

00:05:54.630 --> 00:05:56.910
Third-Rate University

00:05:57.300 --> 00:05:58.560
Class is canceled!

00:05:58.970 --> 00:06:01.460
Again? The Prof's not
long for this world.

00:06:05.310 --> 00:06:06.240
Yo, Godai!

00:06:06.980 --> 00:06:08.270
Wanna go for coffee?

00:06:08.310 --> 00:06:08.980
Sure.

00:06:10.310 --> 00:06:12.500
Geez! I came all the
way out here for this!

00:06:13.650 --> 00:06:15.430
You're buying, right?

00:06:15.980 --> 00:06:16.940
W-What?

00:06:17.320 --> 00:06:19.130
Happy Talk Cafe

00:06:19.650 --> 00:06:20.940
You're such an idiot!

00:06:21.660 --> 00:06:23.120
You deserved that slap!

00:06:23.330 --> 00:06:24.910
People just don't say
things like that!

00:06:25.660 --> 00:06:28.440
It just kinda slipped out.
It was a really bad dream.

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:32.410
Normal people don't
have those dreams.

00:06:32.670 --> 00:06:34.130
Something's wrong with you.

00:06:35.670 --> 00:06:37.310
Maybe it's some
kind of complex.

00:06:43.350 --> 00:06:46.830
It's like I can see her dead
husband standing behind her.

00:06:47.680 --> 00:06:49.260
What kind of man was he?

00:06:50.020 --> 00:06:53.270
What did he look like? How about
his voice? His personality?

00:06:54.360 --> 00:06:55.380
It's all I think of.

00:06:56.360 --> 00:07:00.810
Had to be handsome, for your
manager to stay stuck on him.

00:07:01.700 --> 00:07:02.810
I don't know...

00:07:03.700 --> 00:07:04.990
How wonderful!

00:07:06.030 --> 00:07:10.420
Her husband's gone, but he's the
one and only love of her life.

00:07:11.370 --> 00:07:12.890
That's not a
healthy attitude!

00:07:13.380 --> 00:07:15.160
Why not?
It's so romantic!

00:07:15.710 --> 00:07:16.850
I'll bet they made a vow...

00:07:17.050 --> 00:07:19.860
...that even separated,
their souls would never part.

00:07:20.380 --> 00:07:22.370
No! That's no good at all.

00:07:23.050 --> 00:07:25.800
She has to forget, for
a happy second marriage.

00:07:26.050 --> 00:07:30.210
Take it easy! I mean if you
were thinking of marrying her...

00:07:31.730 --> 00:07:35.480
No way! You're not
thinking that!?

00:07:39.070 --> 00:07:40.030
ls that so bad?

00:07:40.400 --> 00:07:41.770
One cup of coffee, please!

00:07:44.070 --> 00:07:44.940
What's so funny?

00:07:46.410 --> 00:07:48.550
You're so incredibly immature!

00:07:50.750 --> 00:07:56.020
And if I feel that way, older
women are out of the question.

00:07:57.420 --> 00:07:59.230
By the time I graduate...

00:08:00.090 --> 00:08:03.490
How old will you be? The
manager'll be getting older, too.

00:08:03.760 --> 00:08:05.370
She'll never get older!

00:08:07.760 --> 00:08:09.780
T-Thanks! Your treat?

00:08:15.770 --> 00:08:17.000
Thank you!

00:08:17.440 --> 00:08:18.230
See ya!

00:08:19.770 --> 00:08:22.760
You'd better get a paying job
before you worry about marriage!

00:08:23.440 --> 00:08:25.250
But pass your classes first.

00:08:32.450 --> 00:08:34.230
Damn! I hate this!

00:08:35.790 --> 00:08:38.600
Just you wait! One
day I'll be somebody!

00:08:44.800 --> 00:08:46.550
Kyoko, what
are you doing?

00:08:48.140 --> 00:08:51.330
Darling, I'm sorry.
Old habits are hard to break.

00:08:52.140 --> 00:08:53.840
I'm no longer
the Godai of old.

00:08:54.480 --> 00:08:57.730
I graduated valedictorian,
and people envy my salary.

00:08:58.480 --> 00:09:01.730
Let the help
do the laundry.

00:09:02.480 --> 00:09:03.680
Yes, but...

00:09:05.820 --> 00:09:06.810
Long time no see!

00:09:10.160 --> 00:09:13.730
You needn't worry about
a thing. Simply rely on me.

00:09:14.500 --> 00:09:15.760
You're so masterful!

00:09:19.170 --> 00:09:21.310
- - What's with this guy?
- - Look!

00:09:34.850 --> 00:09:36.580
Cup noodles again!

00:09:39.850 --> 00:09:41.340
Time to get a job?

00:09:41.860 --> 00:09:46.430
The public bathhouse is looking
for help. 560 yen an hour.

00:09:48.200 --> 00:09:51.540
Mr. Yotsuya! I keep on
telling you to knock first!

00:09:52.530 --> 00:09:54.870
Only one position is
available. You'd best hurry!

00:09:55.540 --> 00:09:59.260
Why would I want to work
at the public bathhouse?

00:10:01.880 --> 00:10:05.160
Sit at the towel counter
and you can see the women.

00:10:06.880 --> 00:10:07.730
I see.

00:10:07.880 --> 00:10:09.660
Young Godai, if
you take this job...

00:10:10.890 --> 00:10:12.790
...then allow me to
enjoy the view as well!

00:10:13.220 --> 00:10:16.500
But do you think they'd allow a
part-timer at the towel counter?

00:10:17.230 --> 00:10:18.960
It all depends
on your approach.

00:10:19.230 --> 00:10:20.340
I doubt it!

00:10:20.900 --> 00:10:22.450
Simply be persistent!

00:10:25.900 --> 00:10:28.240
Mr. Yotsuya!
Cut it out!

00:10:28.900 --> 00:10:30.190
This is my dinner!

00:10:30.570 --> 00:10:34.990
Young Godai, Soichiro
was never so miserly.

00:10:45.920 --> 00:10:48.610
Y-You met Soichiro?

00:10:53.600 --> 00:10:55.650
He was perfection!

00:10:57.270 --> 00:11:01.050
A handsome face, like a subdued
Tamasaburo, the Kabuki actor.

00:11:01.600 --> 00:11:03.390
In speech:
strong but gentle.

00:11:04.270 --> 00:11:06.990
His method of
proposing was unmatched.

00:11:07.280 --> 00:11:10.060
He held her, kissed her
and proclaimed his feeling!s.

00:11:10.610 --> 00:11:12.690
Only one day after
they first met!

00:11:25.960 --> 00:11:28.860
At least, that's how
I imagine it was.

00:11:32.970 --> 00:11:36.070
If only I had the
chance to meet him.

00:11:36.640 --> 00:11:38.260
Thank you for the noodles!

00:11:39.310 --> 00:11:40.100
No peeping!

00:12:05.330 --> 00:12:07.390
How beautiful.

00:12:09.670 --> 00:12:10.900
Come over here
for a second!

00:12:13.670 --> 00:12:18.090
Look, Soichiro!
The hydrangeas are blooming!

00:12:20.350 --> 00:12:22.250
Kyoko, look at me!

00:12:22.680 --> 00:12:23.580
Smile!

00:12:35.360 --> 00:12:36.530
Soichiro...

00:12:43.040 --> 00:12:44.270
H-Hello?

00:12:45.040 --> 00:12:46.150
Oh, Father!

00:12:49.390 --> 00:12:52.140
S-She wants Godai
as her private tutor?

00:13:09.310 --> 00:13:10.360
Godai?

00:13:10.980 --> 00:13:13.150
Ikoku will be starting
junior high school soon.

00:13:13.650 --> 00:13:17.690
We talked it over and decided
she should have a private tutor.

00:13:18.320 --> 00:13:22.190
Godai seems a nice young
man, and Ikuko likes him.

00:13:23.990 --> 00:13:25.280
What do you think, Kyoko?

00:13:27.660 --> 00:13:29.180
Grandpa!
Lemme talk!

00:13:29.660 --> 00:13:32.150
Hold on, Kyoko.
Ikuko wants to speak to you.

00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:34.710
Hi, Auntie Kyoko!
It's me!

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:37.550
Ikoku, in my opinion...

00:13:38.010 --> 00:13:40.940
...it's good if you
enjoy your studies.

00:13:41.680 --> 00:13:44.930
But for the best grades,
choose your tutor carefully.

00:13:45.350 --> 00:13:46.900
I want Godai!

00:13:47.350 --> 00:13:49.660
I want Godai!
I want Godai!

00:13:50.020 --> 00:13:52.600
Perhaps you could
talk to him about it?

00:13:53.020 --> 00:13:53.720
I-I will.

00:13:55.690 --> 00:13:56.650
Good night.

00:14:09.710 --> 00:14:11.280
Will you cut
it out, Yotsuya?

00:14:12.040 --> 00:14:14.150
Knock all you want,
I'm all out of ramen!

00:14:15.380 --> 00:14:16.610
You're such a pest!

00:14:17.050 --> 00:14:18.630
I-It's me...

00:14:19.720 --> 00:14:22.080
W-Wait!
T-Time out!

00:14:29.060 --> 00:14:30.430
A-A private tutor?

00:14:31.390 --> 00:14:34.000
If you're not interested,
feel free to say no!

00:14:35.060 --> 00:14:37.990
Not at all! I accept the
offer with pleasure!

00:14:38.400 --> 00:14:39.160
I see.

00:14:39.730 --> 00:14:44.390
Since you recommended me,
how could I possibly refuse?

00:14:45.070 --> 00:14:47.060
I-I didn't really...

00:14:47.740 --> 00:14:49.520
I'm so glad you placed
your trust in me!

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:52.140
You can count on me!

00:14:54.080 --> 00:14:55.630
Manager!

00:14:59.420 --> 00:15:01.610
Really? You think I'd
make a good tutor...

00:15:01.760 --> 00:15:03.690
- - Mom wants to talk to you.
- - All right.

00:15:05.430 --> 00:15:07.480
I am an education major...

00:15:07.760 --> 00:15:09.540
I'm confident when
dealing with children.

00:15:10.430 --> 00:15:13.620
I've always liked children.
It's not just that...

00:15:14.440 --> 00:15:16.930
I want to be
of help to you!

00:15:17.440 --> 00:15:19.720
I mean, if
you'll have me, l...

00:15:27.460 --> 00:15:28.560
What's your problem!?

00:15:31.120 --> 00:15:33.550
One mathematics exercise
book, two erasers...

00:15:34.120 --> 00:15:39.070
...an English textbook, and the
teacher's edition, just in case!

00:15:41.800 --> 00:15:42.850
I'm off!

00:15:44.470 --> 00:15:45.640
I'm going, got it?

00:15:48.140 --> 00:15:48.810
Godai!

00:15:49.470 --> 00:15:50.170
Wait!

00:15:51.140 --> 00:15:53.040
Here, give this
to the family.

00:15:54.480 --> 00:15:56.060
Some sweets, as a small gift.

00:15:56.480 --> 00:15:57.270
T-Thanks.

00:15:57.480 --> 00:15:58.880
Your button's come undone.

00:16:10.160 --> 00:16:11.940
- - Formally introduce yourself, okay?
- - Okay!

00:16:13.160 --> 00:16:14.030
Do a good job!

00:16:14.160 --> 00:16:16.240
You can count on me!

00:16:18.170 --> 00:16:19.720
I hope he'll be okay.

00:16:22.170 --> 00:16:23.690
Aren't you the devoted wife?

00:16:24.840 --> 00:16:26.360
What a weird couple!

00:16:26.510 --> 00:16:26.940
You were...

00:16:27.180 --> 00:16:28.910
- -...watching.
- - Saw everything!

00:16:29.510 --> 00:16:33.080
But who thought up the
idea of him as a tutor?

00:16:34.520 --> 00:16:37.360
It looks like your niece
is out to ruin her future.

00:16:37.850 --> 00:16:39.630
You don't have
to go that far...

00:16:40.520 --> 00:16:44.180
I see you don't
trust him either!

00:16:45.190 --> 00:16:48.850
I-It's not that! But he's
not the best provider...

00:16:50.210 --> 00:16:51.510
''Provider''?

00:16:55.210 --> 00:16:56.310
''A provider''?

00:16:56.540 --> 00:16:58.470
She sounded serious.

00:16:58.870 --> 00:16:59.770
Right!?

00:17:00.220 --> 00:17:01.970
What are you
trying to say?

00:17:02.540 --> 00:17:04.760
We'll have plenty to
talk about, over drinks!

00:17:05.220 --> 00:17:06.290
All I have is tea!

00:17:16.890 --> 00:17:18.560
Otonashi

00:17:19.890 --> 00:17:20.530
Excuse me!

00:17:20.900 --> 00:17:22.190
Big brother!

00:17:22.900 --> 00:17:24.300
Come in, Big brother!

00:17:24.570 --> 00:17:25.590
You're here.

00:17:26.230 --> 00:17:26.570
Hello.

00:17:26.570 --> 00:17:28.910
Ikoku, he's your tutor.
You have to call him teacher.

00:17:29.900 --> 00:17:33.270
Hello, I'm Ikuko's mother.
Thank you for tutoring her.

00:17:33.910 --> 00:17:35.970
N-Not at all.
My pleasure!

00:17:36.580 --> 00:17:39.960
I'm afraid she's slightly spoiled.
Scold her if she misbehaves.

00:17:40.250 --> 00:17:41.510
I'll be a good girl!

00:17:42.250 --> 00:17:44.470
You see what I mean?

00:17:47.920 --> 00:17:52.580
You hear it all the time. Women
having affairs with the tutor.

00:17:53.930 --> 00:17:55.980
Nonsense. My sister-in-law
is very respectable!

00:17:56.600 --> 00:17:59.470
But a guy can force
it, if he wants.

00:17:59.930 --> 00:18:01.960
That's right!
They're animals!

00:18:02.270 --> 00:18:03.820
My sister-in-law
is very strong!

00:18:04.610 --> 00:18:07.800
If so, then it's your
niece that's in danger.

00:18:08.610 --> 00:18:11.770
That's not funny. Ikuko is
only twelve years old!

00:18:12.960 --> 00:18:15.060
Girls grow up
fast these days.

00:18:15.280 --> 00:18:17.300
Besides, Godai's
got no self-control.

00:18:17.960 --> 00:18:19.760
Right. He
could carelessly...

00:18:20.290 --> 00:18:22.960
Stop talking like that.
I'm feeling stress pains.

00:18:23.630 --> 00:18:26.350
If something happened to her,
I could never apologize!

00:18:27.300 --> 00:18:30.470
Oh Lord, please prevent anything
dreadful from happening!

00:18:31.970 --> 00:18:34.110
- - She's fun to tease!
- - She's too serious.

00:18:39.970 --> 00:18:42.430
This is the verb ''to be, '' got it?

00:18:42.980 --> 00:18:44.530
What if ''Tom '' was the subject?

00:18:46.980 --> 00:18:48.320
Are you in
love with anybody?

00:18:48.980 --> 00:18:50.620
Don't get off the subject.

00:18:50.990 --> 00:18:53.480
You're avoiding the
question! You are in love!

00:18:54.320 --> 00:18:56.190
You're avoiding
the question!

00:18:56.660 --> 00:18:58.470
You avoided
the question again!

00:18:59.330 --> 00:19:01.910
- - I've brought some tea.
- - Substitute for X in the formula!

00:19:02.330 --> 00:19:03.530
Yes, sir!

00:19:04.670 --> 00:19:06.280
Why don't you take a break?

00:19:06.670 --> 00:19:07.980
Please, don't mind me.

00:19:09.340 --> 00:19:10.980
Are you working hard?

00:19:11.340 --> 00:19:12.540
Of course!

00:19:13.680 --> 00:19:15.900
Take good care of Ikuko, now.

00:19:18.680 --> 00:19:20.670
Don't bother Mr. Godai too much!

00:19:21.020 --> 00:19:21.810
I won't!

00:19:23.350 --> 00:19:24.660
Break time!
Wanna play?

00:19:25.020 --> 00:19:26.010
I'm exhausted.

00:19:26.020 --> 00:19:28.040
l know. I'll show
you my photo album!

00:19:28.360 --> 00:19:28.970
Yeah, sure.

00:19:30.690 --> 00:19:32.720
Why does this always
happen to ME!?

00:19:33.360 --> 00:19:34.850
Look, look!

00:19:35.360 --> 00:19:37.060
This is me on my
seven-year-old ceremony.

00:19:37.370 --> 00:19:38.860
I got to go
to the Meiji Shrine!

00:19:39.370 --> 00:19:41.120
Yeah, you were cute.

00:19:43.370 --> 00:19:45.920
With Uncle Soichiro.

00:19:47.720 --> 00:19:48.790
T-This picture!

00:19:49.040 --> 00:19:51.290
Don't I look
pretty in a dress?

00:19:52.050 --> 00:19:54.630
Sure. You look
good in a dress. But...

00:19:55.050 --> 00:19:57.930
Thank you! Next, pictures
from my school play.

00:19:58.390 --> 00:20:00.390
N-No. T-This picture
on the bottom...

00:20:01.060 --> 00:20:02.520
It's nothing special...

00:20:02.720 --> 00:20:04.090
His face is ripped.

00:20:04.390 --> 00:20:06.470
I ripped it; I was naughty.

00:20:07.060 --> 00:20:08.260
That's too bad.

00:20:09.060 --> 00:20:11.210
Your uncle must have
been a handsome guy.

00:20:12.400 --> 00:20:14.830
Not really.
He was kind of weird.

00:20:16.070 --> 00:20:18.680
Look, I was the star:
Princess Kaguya!

00:20:19.070 --> 00:20:21.030
- - Do you see?
- - Sure I do. That's pretty.

00:20:22.740 --> 00:20:23.530
Next one is...

00:20:23.750 --> 00:20:25.040
...Auntie Kyoko!

00:20:26.410 --> 00:20:28.280
It was taken just after she
married into the family.

00:20:30.080 --> 00:20:31.890
Uncle Soichiro took it!

00:20:33.430 --> 00:20:34.500
What's wrong?

00:20:35.430 --> 00:20:37.970
Hey, Godai!

00:20:39.090 --> 00:20:43.040
My New Auntie

00:20:52.110 --> 00:20:53.110
Well, I'll be going.

00:20:53.110 --> 00:20:54.370
So sorry to keep you.

00:20:55.440 --> 00:20:57.580
We look forward
to the next lesson.

00:20:58.460 --> 00:20:59.120
Thanks.

00:20:59.460 --> 00:21:00.850
Don't ever stop
tutoring me!

00:21:01.120 --> 00:21:01.890
Yes, ma'am.

00:21:05.790 --> 00:21:07.140
See ya!

00:21:10.470 --> 00:21:12.070
I'm nothing more
than her babysitter.

00:21:13.470 --> 00:21:15.360
It's so late.

00:21:19.140 --> 00:21:20.530
He should be
home by now.

00:21:21.140 --> 00:21:22.400
What is he doing?

00:21:25.140 --> 00:21:26.140
My older-woman lover!

00:21:26.140 --> 00:21:27.160
My student lover!

00:22:14.520 --> 00:22:15.930
Her peaceful smile...

00:22:17.530 --> 00:22:19.550
The face of a woman
depending on a man.

00:22:21.210 --> 00:22:24.460
I've never seen
her smile like that.

00:22:39.550 --> 00:22:40.600
Hi, I'm home.

00:22:42.220 --> 00:22:43.270
ls something wrong?

00:22:44.220 --> 00:22:46.910
N-No. I just
wondered how it went?

00:22:55.230 --> 00:22:58.600
Oh, no. Did
something bad happen?

00:23:02.570 --> 00:23:05.560
There it is. That worried
look she always has for me.

00:23:12.580 --> 00:23:14.720
Hey manager, let's smile!

00:23:20.930 --> 00:23:22.500
That's it!
Smiles are best.

00:23:23.260 --> 00:23:24.220
T-That's true.

00:23:30.930 --> 00:23:32.460
He's pretending to be cheerful.

00:23:33.600 --> 00:23:34.890
Something must have happened!

00:23:39.610 --> 00:23:41.690
Okay...Just try and stop me!

00:23:51.290 --> 00:23:53.160
Stop it, Godai! No!

00:23:53.290 --> 00:23:55.840
I don't care how drunk you
are, this is unforgivable!

00:23:56.970 --> 00:24:00.500
Next: ''Godai's Unspeakable Declaration!
If You're Going to Do It, Do It! ''

00:24:01.640 --> 00:24:03.060
Love is not
something you scream.

00:24:03.300 --> 00:24:05.850
Love is a precious
feeling within your heart.
